		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Undead specter created by murder, fueled by an eternal quest for vengeance.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 12 (leather), <strong>HP</strong> 20, <strong>ATK</strong> 1 claw +4 (1d8), <strong>MV</strong> near, <strong>S</strong> +3, <strong>D</strong> +1, <strong>C</strong> +2, <strong>I</strong> -1, <strong>W</strong> +0, <strong>Ch</strong> +3, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 4</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Greater Undead</strong>. Immune to morale checks. Only damaged by silver or magical sources.</p><p></p><p><strong>Vengeance</strong>. If destroyed, arises with full HP in 2d4 days. Eternally put to rest if murderer dies. Can sense direction of murderer, can see them even if invisible.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
